          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">3-BEDROOM CONDO</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">80-120 boxes mixed</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">LANDED FAMILY HOME</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">150-200 boxes mixed</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">FULL ESTATE CLEAR</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">200+ boxes (incl. storage)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">House Clearance FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">How many used boxes do I need for a 3-bedroom house?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">80-120 mixed boxes plus tape, bubble wrap, and 10-15 hanging-format wardrobe boxes for garments still on hangers.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Are used boxes strong enough for delicate items?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes. Our Grade A and B used boxes have already proven their strength on a first journey. Pair with bubble wrap for crockery and glass.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Can you deliver same-day for an urgent clearance?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — WhatsApp before 11am for same-day delivery to Cheras, Balakong, Kajang, Seri Kembangan, Sungai Long. Other areas next day.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do you accept returns of unused boxes?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Not for cash refund, but we sometimes buy back clean surplus at a reduced rate. Ask us for current buyback prices.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Is the RM 1,000 minimum order too steep for a clearance?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Most full-house jobs exceed RM 1,000 once you add bubble wrap, tape, and stretch film. For smaller jobs, ask your mover to bundle your portion into theirs.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

