        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">House clearance, estate sale, downsizing, or second-hand reseller — Quinocycle stocks the bulk used cartons you need at wholesale rates. Same-day delivery available in core Klang Valley areas.</p>
